      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表非常喜欢自由奔跑，\n这次的行为，\n也非常符合她随心所欲的风格。",
      "source_fingerprint": "911b30fbe2e90b50d4c1912374474f42c8933271d262a307268c57c42a792fe7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
